[Fact:spectrumcomputing:Spectrum Computing]
<a href="https://spectrumcomputing.co.uk/entry/7157"
  rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Velnor's Lair</a>
(Derek Brewster, Neptune Computing 1983; Quicksilva reissue; sequel Kentilla).

[Fact:caraland:Myths And Legends Of Caraland]
Velnor's Lair is the first of Derek Brewster's two "Myths and Legends of
Caraland" games for the ZX Spectrum; the sequel is Kentilla. See
<a href="https://spectrumcomputing.co.uk/entry/7157"
  rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Spectrum Computing</a>.
